# VID-04 — Accessible controls / no keyboard trap

## Rationale

Interactive video needs `controls` or accessible custom controls and must not trap
keyboard focus.

## How to check

Confirm `controls` exists or custom controls are keyboard-operable and labeled.

## How to fix

User adds `controls` or wires accessible custom controls.
